*** Scope of this file ***

This module is released as part of DISCO (Detector Interface for Streaming,
Control, and Open-source integration), an LBNL project, and carries DISCO's
licence terms. It needs its own copy of those terms because it is a DERIVATIVE
WORK of EPICS areaDetector and is obliged to carry areaDetector's notice
alongside them. Both are reproduced below.

